<p>As India's trusted <strong>SS 304 316L pipe supplier</strong>, we help buyers select the right welded grade. 304/304L — general purpose, food, dairy, architecture. 316/316L — marine, chemical, pharmaceutical (the "L" grade prevents sensitisation at weld HAZ). 321 — continuous high-temperature service. 309/310S — furnace and kiln applications up to 1100°C.</p>

